• Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Console.ConsoleLoggerOptions.IncludeScopes?displayProperty=nameWithType

• Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Console.ConsoleLoggerOptions.TimestampFormat?displayProperty=nameWithType

• Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Console.ConsoleLoggerOptions.UseUtcTimestamp?displayProperty=nameWithType

• Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Console.ConsoleLoggerOptions.Format?displayProperty=nameWithType

With the introduction of new formatters, these properties are now available on the individual formatters.

