Cause

The parameter 'parameter' of method 'method' has a System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis.DynamicallyAccessedMembersAttribute annotation, but the value passed to it can't be statically analyzed. Trimmer cannot make sure that the requirements declared by the attribute are met by the argument value.

