The return value of method 'method' has a System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis.DynamicallyAccessedMembersAttribute annotation, but the value returned from the method cannot be statically analyzed. Trimmer cannot make sure that the requirements declared by the attribute are met by the returned value.

