The field 'field' has a System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis.DynamicallyAccessedMembersAttribute annotation, but the value assigned to it can not be statically analyzed. Trimmer cannot make sure that the requirements declared by the attribute are met by the assigned value.

Example

