Cause

The method 'method' has a System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis.DynamicallyAccessedMembersAttribute annotation (which applies to the implicit this parameter), but the value used for the this parameter cannot be statically analyzed. Trimmer cannot make sure that the requirements declared by the attribute are met by the this value.

