The MakeToastWithButterAndJamAsync method has the async modifier in its signature that signals to the compiler that the method contains an await expression and contains asynchronous operations. The method represents the task that toasts the bread, then spreads the butter and jam. The method returns a [System.Threading.Tasks.Task1](xref:System.Threading.Tasks.Task1) object that represents the composition of the three operations.

